      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHES ALLABOUTLUV NZ (3) is racing very well this preparation with nine wins to her credit, the latest effort a third over 1680m at this track. No excuses from this advantageous draw. Meets a similar line up so she can add to the impressive recent efforts. INTRUSION (9) was successful at his most recent outing by 3.5 metres in a far better performance at Hobart over 2090m. May need luck at some stage extracting from the inside of the second row. Needs to be at his best to beat this field but he is up to the challenge. SABINE (2) is right in contention after finishing in the placings for the second time in a row last start, beaten 4 metres into second at this track. No reason she cannot take this out. WAVES OF CHANCE (8) is the next elect off a last-start win by 4 metres at this track over 1680m.",
